# Local reference values — TEMPLATE

Copy to `references.local.md` and fill in the values for this machine. That file is
gitignored and must stay that way.

One `- NAME: value` per line. Names are declared in `references.md`; a value here whose
name is not declared there is a value nobody reviewed.

- UPSTREAM_PIPELINES_ROOT: <absolute path to the private deployment repository's pipeline apps directory>
